WEBVTT

1
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:09,440
At least I can get through today

2
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:15,800
Food, really food

3
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:17,800
Oh my god, it’s food.

4
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:20,800
Bread, that's bread, ham sausage and mineral water

5
00:00:27,830 --> 00:00:29,830
Line up, who dares to grab it?

6
00:00:29,830 --> 00:00:31,830
The first one I have is not that big.

7
00:00:37,510 --> 00:00:38,510
If you want to eat, queue up

8
00:00:38,510 --> 00:00:40,770
Come one by one

9
00:00:41,770 --> 00:00:48,700
Old classmate, pick up

10
00:00:48,700 --> 00:01:06,420
Do you believe me now?
